 folder←Recover folder;links;opts;reset
⍝ Tidy up after a test that failed or errored: it will not have reached its own CleanUp,
⍝ so break its links, expunge its namespace and delete its folder so the next test starts from scratch.
⍝ Returns the folder for the next test: a fresh one if the old one could not be deleted (e.g. still held by a crawler)
 MOCK_OFF←0
 reset←{ ⍝ a valid Link configuration file for folder ⍵, as Setup makes it: the test may have damaged it (test_config writes
     ⍝ invalid JSON on purpose), and Break does nothing while the configuration cannot be read - so this comes first
     0::Log'Could not reset the Link configuration file: ',⎕DMX.(EM,(×≢Message)/': ',Message)
     ⎕SE.Link.USERCONFIGFILE←⍵,'-config/.linkconfig'
     _←3 ⎕MKDIR ⍵,'-config'
     _←(⊂'{Settings:{}}')⎕NPUT ⎕SE.Link.USERCONFIGFILE 1
 }
 reset folder
 :Trap 0
     :If 0≠CountLinks
         links←⎕SE.Link.Links.ns~IGNORE_LINKS
         (opts←⎕NS ⍬).recursive←'on' ⍝ all in one call, each with everything linked below it: one by one, Break refuses a parent while its child is still linked
         {0::Log'Could not break links ',(⍕⍵),': ',⎕DMX.(EM,(×≢Message)/': ',Message) ⋄ _←opts ⎕SE.Link.Break ⍵}links
     :EndIf
     ⎕EX NAME
     3 ⎕NDELETE Retry⊢folder
 :Else
     Log'Could not tidy up after failed test: ',⎕DMX.(EM,(×≢Message)/': ',Message)
     :Trap 0
         Log'Continuing in a new folder: ',folder←CreateTempDir 1
         reset folder ⍝ the configuration file lives beside the folder
     :Else
         Log'Could not create a new folder either: ',⎕DMX.(EM,(×≢Message)/': ',Message)
     :EndTrap
 :EndTrap
